I exclude potentially dangerous items from autopickup to make handling
them a concious decision.

I use this menucolor config:
##############################
# WATCH OUT, BAG OF HOLDING! #
##############################
MENUCOLOR=3D" bag .* tricks"=3Dred&underline
MENUCOLOR=3D" wand .*[^!]canc"=3Dred&underline
MENUCOLOR=3D" wand .* msg_van"=3Dred&underline
MENUCOLOR=3D" wand called .* vanish( .*)?$"=3Dred&underline

# individually name or collectively call dangerous items a color code
MENUCOLOR=3D"\{R\}\{U\}"=3Dred&underline


Actually, I should make all bags of holding except my main one display
